{"availability":"available","full":"nemanjam/next-auth-custom-provider-demo","name":"next-auth-custom-provider-demo","description":"Custom Next-auth OAuth provider for Square with Prisma and Postgres.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":16,"forks":6,"created":"2023-04-14T08:13:04Z","updated":"2023-06-15T20:57:01Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://next-auth-custom-provider-demo.vercel.app","topics":["next-auth","next-auth-provider","nextjs","oauth2","postgresql","prisma"],"demo":"https://squareup.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:48.878Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:48.878Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:48.878Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:32.997Z","stars":16,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:38:24.522Z","stars":16,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:03:48.878Z","stars":16,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Demo app for Next-auth custom provider using OAuth provider. Provider implementation is in lib/providers/square.ts. Login is fully functional and uses sandbox test account, you must login with provided test account into Square dashboard and open Default Test Account in another tab and then you can test the login with Square in the demo.","Demo allows login with Square, creating, publishing and deleting posts, and reseeding database for another test. It is hosted on Vercel and uses external Postgres database on separate server. It must use low latency database or login will time out and throw error.","There are also custom provider implementations for Uber and Yelp in lib/providers/ but they are untested and incomplete, Uber doesn't allow profile scope for unverified apps (even though docs states opposite) and Yelp doesn't support Serbia for business accounts."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nemanjam/next-auth-custom-provider-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2e0e1a23058af0507a8d6c3b72b990a1a31241ddf3841d5026c9de